# Aave V3.0 Environment Configuration
# Choose either HyperEVM Testnet OR Local Anvil by commenting/uncommenting sections

# HyperEVM Testnet Configuration
# Uncomment these lines for testnet deployment
# PRIVATE_KEY=your_private_key_without_0x_prefix
# RPC_URL=https://rpc.hyperliquid-testnet.xyz/evm
# CHAIN_ID=998

# Local Anvil Configuration  
# Uncomment these lines for local development (requires running 'anvil' in another terminal)
# PRIVATE_KEY=0xac0974bec39a17e36ba4a6b4d238ff944bacb478cbed5efcae784d7bf4f2ff80
# RPC_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8545
# CHAIN_ID=31337

# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file: cp .env.example .env
# 2. Uncomment the configuration section you want to use
# 3. For HyperEVM Testnet: Replace 'your_private_key_without_0x_prefix' with your actual private key
# 4. For Local Anvil: Start anvil with 'anvil' command in another terminal